== Trivia ==
* His name and appearance are based on [[Wikipedia:Krampus|Krampus]], an alpine folkloric figure. It supposedly acts as a antithesis to [[Wikipedia:Santa Claus|Saint Nicholas]], punishing children who misbehave near Christmas time.
** This is most likely why {{i|A Lump of Coal}} is in his item pool.
* Krampus is both visually and behaviorally similar to {{e|The Fallen}}.
* Krampus is tied with {{e|The Fallen}} as having the highest [[Stage HP]] among all entities in the game.
* In an [https://www.reddit.com/r/IAmA/comments/8um4er/edmund_mcmillen_here_known_for_the_binding_of/ AMA subreddit thread for Edmund McMillen], a user questioned why Krampus got "worse with every update." Edmund McMillen jokingly responded, "he's the new bloat."; referencing the general hatred some fans have towards {{e|The Bloat}}.
* {{dlc|r}} Despite Krampus receiving a redesign in ''Repentance'', Delirium's Krampus appearance has yet to be updated.
* {{dlc+|r}} Red {{r|Mini-Boss Room}}s created by {{i|Red Key}} (etc.) can contain a battle against Krampus.{{dlc-}}

